# Product Requirements Document: Gold Shipper

## 1\. Overview

**App/Website Name:** Gold Shipper

Gold Shipper is a comprehensive web platform designed for Mansa Resources to digitize and track gold and silver shipments and sales across their West African operations in Guinea, Côte d'Ivoire, and Mali. The platform provides end-to-end traceability from mine extraction to final sale, enabling real-time visibility into operations, automated calculations, workflow management, and comprehensive analytics for management oversight.

The application serves mining professionals, logistics coordinators, refinery operators, customers, and management across multiple countries and roles. It solves critical challenges in manual tracking, calculation errors, lack of real-time visibility, compliance requirements, and operational inefficiencies in precious metals supply chain management.

